<https://hexplain.io/ns/bddo#BaseType> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use in physical binary-format descriptions. Extents and offsets describe bytes unless a term explicitly specifies bits; HEL evaluation and failure behavior follow the processing specification. Assert this class on a resource representing the defined entity."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/bddo#BigEndian> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Byte order placing the most significant byte of a multi-byte value first."@en .
