<https://hexplain.io/ns/bddo#BigEndian> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://hexplain.io/ns/bddo> .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/bddo#BitOrder> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The order in which bits are consumed within a byte for sub-byte fields; independent of multi-byte endianness."@en .
