<https://hexplain.io/ns/bddo#ConditionalEndiannessShape> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A reusable validation contract for bddo:endianness, bddo:hasConditionalEndianness. Every member of a hasConditionalEndianness list must be a bddo:EndiannessRule. bddo:endianness and bddo:hasConditionalEndianness are mutually exclusive. bddo:hasConditionalEndianness must point to a single rdf:List."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/bddo#ConditionalEndiannessShape> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Validation activation: subjects using bddo:hasConditionalEndianness Constraints apply only within that activation or through shape references; they are not global OWL domain axioms."@en .
